  "slug": "seo-assistant-silverbee",
  "name": "Seo Assistant Silverbee",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered SEO assistant for Claude — gives Claude live access to Google Search Console, Ahrefs, DataForSEO, Google Analytics, Web Vitals, and 10+ data sources. Specialized skills for keyword research, technical SEO audits, content optimization, competitor analysis, link building, and automated workflow execution.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install seo-assistant-silverbee@claude-community` from `silverbee-ai/claude-silverbee-marketplace`.\n\nOfficial marketplace for the Silverbee Claude Code plugin.\n\nAI-powered SEO assistant for Claude — gives Claude live access to Google Search Console, Ahrefs, DataForSEO, Google Analytics, Web Vitals, and 10+ data sources. Specialized skills for keyword research, technical SEO audits, content optimization, competitor analysis, link building, and automated workflow execution.",
